# SETURA — root .gitignore
# Established at the G7-03 repository-hygiene / release baseline (2026-09-19).
#
# Scope discipline: this file ignores ONLY local / generated / tooling
# artifacts. Project source of truth REMAINS tracked and is deliberately
# NOT ignored: application source, tests, migrations, Edge Functions,
# shared modules, frontend source, configuration, scripts, CI workflow,
# `.env.example` (placeholders), the migration MANIFEST, and the
# authoritative root-level *.md evidence reports.

# --- Agent / tooling local scratch ---
.remember/
.ua/

# --- Qoder generated repository wiki (D9) ---
# Generated documentation output. Not a build input, not a runtime input,
# not referenced by CI or any non-generated source file.
.qoder/

# --- Supabase CLI local state (never part of source of truth) ---
supabase/.temp/
supabase/.branches/

# --- Dependency / build output (defense-in-depth; apps/web/.gitignore also covers) ---
node_modules/

# --- Session / run logs ---
# Generic rule catches new disposable run logs. The specific logs that
# Phase 7 completion reports cite as authoritative evidence are explicitly
# allow-listed below so they remain trackable (a blanket *.log must never
# silently hide required project evidence). The general evidence-log
# retention policy remains open decision D15.
*.log

# Retained authoritative run evidence (referenced by Phase 7 reports)
!_e1_run1.log
!_e1_run2.log
!_e1_run3.log
!_e1_run4.log
!_g701_repro1.log
!_g701_regression_worker.log
!_g707_scheduler.log
!_w1_test.log
!_integration_full.log

# --- Graphify navigation index (D8) ---
# Whether to track `graphify-out/` + `GRAPH_REPORT.md` is a project/
# governance decision. G7-02 recorded it as DEFERRED (D8); it is NOT
# silently resolved here, so no ignore rule is applied and the existing
# files remain tracked.
# graphify-out/
